  "description": "One day, an amnesiac woman suddenly invades the quiet home of an ordinary man.\nHe soon discovers that she is the wife of the gangster who lives next door. On top of that, the gangster is being hunted and gives the protagonist a special request: protect and look after his wife.\n\nWhat starts as an unexpected and awkward situation quickly becomes a complicated and dangerous living arrangement.\n\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_wife_wz), [Toomics](https://toomics.com/click/intro?cno=5486&pid=webtoonguide), [Anytoon](https://www.anytoon.co.kr/webtoon/episode/none?ind=2537)",
